igcaption></figure><p>低密度膽固醇過高要吃什麼？4大飲食原則降低LDL-C，搭配運動更健康！</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T01:53:31.935171+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1933,"images":25,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T01:30:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T02:47:52.273244+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T01:47:00.794889+00:00","content_hash":"349e1e93c4ed66708887b89ffaef0d938a48e56829fce4518dd073e203d543ce","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}